  :polarity :toward-accumulation
  :magnitude 0.52 :confidence 0.4
  :basis "Plastic Waste Management Rules 2016 (amended 2022) EPR/PIBO registration and compliance-audit reporting shows uneven state-level enforcement intensity; hypothesis: enforcement gaps let non-compliant plastic packaging keep entering the accumulation-prone stream."
